WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,090
aunt dad

2
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:03,890
Brother Cheng has gained a lot of weight now

3
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,730
Don't tire your aunt

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:12,690
How can that prince be so exaggerated?

5
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:21,540
Let's go to the study and sit down. Your Majesty invites you.

6
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,260
Knowing that I will come back today

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:26,780
I don’t know what to restrain myself from

8
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,260
Why don’t I restrain myself?

9
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,330
Hahaha

10
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:32,490
Now I can see with my own eyes the wishful man in my little sister’s mouth

11
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:34,130
Like a god descending to earth

12
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:40,530
No wonder the girl is so determined with just one yuan.

13
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,450
All married

14
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,170
She even got married like a spoiled brat.

15
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:45,820
I am also my mother’s daughter, but

16
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,740
Why are you suddenly thinking of moving here?

17
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,500
After all, we became the Qing family with the Hou Mansion.

18
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,620
We can't stay in that little house on Tianshui Lane, right?
